@startuml seq-analytics
title Поток данных: аналитика просмотров и рекомендации

left to right direction
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

actor Viewer as viewer
rectangle "Client Player" as player
rectangle "API Gateway" as gw
queue "Event Bus\n(Kafka)" as kafka
rectangle "Analytics Pipeline\n(Beam → BigQuery)" as beam
database "Metadata Store" as meta
rectangle "Recommendation Engine" as rec

player   --> gw    : watch events batch\n(position_sec, drop-off points,\nbuffer_health, skip patterns)
gw       --> kafka : video.watched\n(~100B+ событий/день)

kafka    --> beam  : stream processing
beam     --> meta  : QoE-метрики (rebuffer_rate, retention)\nCDN health алерты
beam     --> rec   : обновление признаков (batch, ~1 ч)
rec      --> meta  : updated recommendations

viewer   --> gw    : GET /recommendations
gw       --> meta  : read top-K for user
meta     --> viewer : персональная лента

note bottom of rec
  offline batch (~1 ч) vs online re-rank (при каждом открытии)
  сбой pipeline → fallback на popularity-based, плейбэк не блокируется
end note

@enduml
